---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getDB } from '../lib/db';

const db = getDB();
let totalMembers = 0;
try {
  if (db) {
    const mc: any = await db.prepare("SELECT COUNT(*) as cnt FROM members").first();
    totalMembers = mc?.cnt || 0;
  }
} catch {}
const memberLabel = totalMembers ? `${totalMembers}+` : '80+';
---
<Base title="About" description="Why Denver Social exists, and the story behind the table for 8 that started it.">

<style is:inline>
  .ab { color: var(--text); }
  .ab-wrap { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--space-4); }

  /* Hero — full-bleed teal mesh */
  .ab-hero {
    margin-top: -88px; padding: 124px var(--space-4) var(--space-7);
    text-align: center; color: #fff; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #0C6E63;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 16% 16%, rgba(21,128,61,0.95), transparent 42%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 84% 14%, rgba(122,83,176,0.9), transparent 44%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 96%, rgba(232,144,42,0.8), transparent 40%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #0E8A7D, #0B5C54);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .ab-hero { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 44px; } }
  .ab-k { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .ab-hero .ab-k { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .ab-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6.5vw, 64px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-4); max-width: 14ch; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
  }
  .ab-hero h1 em { font-style: normal; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; color: var(--accent2); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.12em; }
  .ab-hero p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.94); font-size: 18px; max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.55; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* Photo collage — lifts up over the hero edge */
  .ab-photos {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;
    height: 320px; margin: calc(var(--space-7) * -1) auto var(--space-7);
    max-width: 1000px; padding: 0 var(--space-4); position: relative; z-index: 2;
  }
  .ab-photos > div { border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background-size: cover; background-position: center; box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.18); border: 4px solid #fff; }
  .ab-photos .p1 { grid-row: 1 / 3; background-image: url('/hero/red-rocks.jpg'); background-color: #1f5e55; }
  .ab-photos .p2 { background-image: url('/hero/foothills.jpg'); background-color: #2f6f63; }
  .ab-photos .p3 { background-image: url('/hero/skyline.jpg'); background-color: #3a5a7a; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .ab-photos { height: 230px; } }

  /* Story */
  .ab-story { padding: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-6); }
  .ab-story h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .ab-by { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--text-sec); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .ab-by .av { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(140deg, var(--accent), #0B5C54); color: #fff; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; }
  .ab-story p { font-size: 17px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .ab-story em { color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; }
  .ab-quote { font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent2); line-height: 1.1; text-align: center; margin: var(--space-5) 0; }
  .ab-rules { background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5); margin-top: var(--space-3); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ab-rules span { color: var(--accent); }

  /* Stats strip */
  .ab-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-6); flex-wrap: wrap; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ab-stat { text-align: center; }
  .ab-stat-n { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1; }
  .ab-stat-l { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-sec); margin-top: 6px; font-weight: 500; }

  /* Pillars */
  .ab-pillars { padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4); }
  .ab-pillars-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ab-pillars h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(24px, 3.6vw, 34px); font-weight: 800; text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--space-5); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .ab-pillars h2 em { font-style: normal; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; color: var(--accent2); font-size: 1.15em; }
  .ab-pgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-4); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .ab-pgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .ab-pill { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: var(--space-5); box-shadow: var(--card-shadow); border-top: 4px solid var(--c); transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  .ab-pill:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 24%, transparent); }
  .ab-pill .e { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 12%, #fff); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .ab-pill h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .ab-pill p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--text-sec); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* CTA */
  .ab-cta { text-align: center; padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4); position: relative; overflow: hidden; color: #fff;
    background-color: #0C6E63;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(232,144,42,0.5), transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(122,83,176,0.6), transparent 45%), linear-gradient(135deg, #0E8A7D, #0B5C54);
  }
  .ab-cta h2 { font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 56px); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .ab-cta-btns { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .ab-btn { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; padding: 15px 32px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  .ab-btn-primary { background: #fff; color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.28); }
  .ab-btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(0,0,0,0.34); }
  .ab-btn-ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color: #fff; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .ab-btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22); transform: translateY(-2px); }
</style>

<div class="ab">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <header class="ab-hero">
    <div class="ab-k">Since 2026 · Denver, Colorado</div>
    <h1>Making friends in Denver is <em>hard.</em></h1>
    <p>A small community, run by one person, built on the idea that you shouldn't need an app full of strangers to grab dinner on a Tuesday.</p>
  </header>

  <!-- PHOTO COLLAGE -->
  <div class="ab-photos">
    <div class="p1"></div>
    <div class="p2"></div>
    <div class="p3"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="ab-wrap ab-story">
    <div class="ab-k">The story</div>
    <h2>How a table for 8 in RiNo turned into this.</h2>
    <div class="ab-by"><span class="av">S</span> Seth · Host · Fellow Denverite</div>
    <p>I moved to Denver from Louisiana a couple years ago. Making friends in a new city was rough — bars too loud, meetups had 400 people standing around awkwardly, and Bumble BFF felt like a job interview. All I wanted was a few people to grab dinner with on a Tuesday.</p>
    <p>So I booked a table for 8 in RiNo and posted it. Strangers showed up.</p>
    <div class="ab-quote">“when's the next one?”</div>
    <p>People kept asking — so we kept going. Bowling, hikes, pottery, terrace hangs, big potlucks. There's <strong>{memberLabel}</strong> of us now — dinners stay small, but a hike or game night might be twenty.</p>
    <p>If you've ever found it hard to meet people here, that's the whole reason this exists — to make Denver feel <em>a little smaller</em>, one table at a time.</p>
    <div class="ab-rules">Don't be a creep. Show up if you say you will. Be kind. <span>That's it.</span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <section class="ab-stats">
    <div class="ab-stat"><div class="ab-stat-n">{memberLabel}</div><div class="ab-stat-l">neighbors at the table</div></div>
    <div class="ab-stat"><div class="ab-stat-n">$0</div><div class="ab-stat-l">to host or join — always</div></div>
    <div class="ab-stat"><div class="ab-stat-n">2026</div><div class="ab-stat-l">since one dinner in RiNo</div></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PILLARS -->
  <section class="ab-pillars">
    <div class="ab-pillars-inner">
      <h2>What we're <em>not.</em></h2>
      <div class="ab-pgrid">
        <div class="ab-pill" style="--c:#0E8A7D">
          <div class="e">🚫</div>
          <h3>No algorithm</h3>
          <p>Events show up in the order they happen. The thing on top is the thing happening soonest — not what an engagement model picks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-pill" style="--c:#E8902A">
          <div class="e">💸</div>
          <h3>No paid tier</h3>
          <p>Hosting is free. RSVPing is free. Always. Nothing locked behind a paywall.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-pill" style="--c:#7A53B0">
          <div class="e">📭</div>
          <h3>No spam</h3>
          <p>You can't message someone without a mutual RSVP. The whole point is the in-person meet.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ab-cta">
    <h2>So — see you Saturday?</h2>
    <div class="ab-cta-btns">
      <a class="ab-btn ab-btn-primary" href="/events">Find something this week</a>
      <a class="ab-btn ab-btn-ghost" href="/signup">Join the community</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</Base>
